# --- firmware ---------------------------------------------------------------
# armbian-firmware contains everything the Rock 5B needs (verified contents):
#   lib/firmware/arm/mali/arch10.8/mali_csffw.bin  (panthor GPU firmware)
#   lib/firmware/rtw89/rtw8852b_fw-1.bin           (RTL8852BE Wi-Fi)
#   lib/firmware/rtl_bt/rtl8852bu_fw.bin           (Bluetooth)
# It Provides/Conflicts with linux-firmware, firmware-realtek, firmware-ralink,
# firmware-samsung and firmware-brcm80211, so lb-config-trixie.sh disables
# live-build's automatic firmware selection (--firmware-chroot false).
# To use Debian firmware instead: remove armbian-firmware here, then re-enable
# --firmware-chroot in lb-config-trixie.sh and list firmware-realtek /
# firmware-misc-nonfree here.
armbian-firmware

